OL,3,GNEWSAOrkney island's second recorded
OL,4,Astoat trapped and killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second stoat has been trapped and
OL,7,Fkilled on Rousay in Orkney, just weeks
OL,8,Fafter what was hoped to have been the
OL,9,Fisland's only stoat was caught.
OL,11,FThe mammals are not native to Orkney
OL,12,Fand prey on ground-nesting birds as
OL,13,Fwell as a subspecies of vole that is
OL,14,Fnot found anywhere else in the world.
OL,16,FRousay's first-ever confirmed stoat was
OL,17,Ftrapped on 9 October near Loch of
OL,18,FLoomachun as part of a #15m project to
OL,19,Feradicate the predator from across
OL,20,FOrkney.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
